      762                                        out-vatp_gds-dtlcl.prod-code = parprod-code no-lock no-error.
      763   if available out-vatp_gds-dtlcl then do:
      764     find first buf_out-vatp_gds-dtlcl where buf_out-vatp_gds-dtlcl.doc-code  =  pardoc-code                and
